{"Put out the lantern. Then look at the window. Whatever is written there will take you to her. Will you do that for me?": [0.0, 6.357], "Did you read what’s written on the window?": [6.757, 2.859], "Then you know what to count.": [10.016, 2.155], "Put out the lantern. The writing only shows in the dark.": [12.571, 3.819], "The glass doesn’t lie. Read it again.": [16.789, 2.859], "Do you know what the bells are?": [20.048, 2.219], "Thirty one boats. Thirty one bells.": [22.667, 2.944], "Turn to station forty nine. The history will tell you.": [26.011, 3.84], "Ask the terminal. It knows.": [30.251, 2.539], "Will you go to her tonight?": [33.189, 1.963], "Count carefully. Then turn the dial.": [35.552, 2.88], "She’ll wait. She’s good at waiting.": [38.832, 2.581], "Have you counted the bells yet?": [41.813, 2.539], "Then you know where she is. Turn the dial.": [44.752, 2.944], "There were thirty one boats. Each one had a bell.": [48.096, 3.243], "Listen to station forty nine. Count with them.": [51.739, 3.499]}